specs/hal-engine-architecture/spec.md:326:8. This repeats while `round <= maxToolRounds`, counted from zero, so the default of 5 permits six model calls in total ([validated by: stops asking for tools once maxToolRounds is spent](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.test.ts#L422))
specs/hal-engine-architecture/spec.md:330:- A round continues only when the model stopped for `tool_use`, named at least one tool, and a `ToolRegistry` is configured ([validated by: continues when the model requested a tool and a registry can run it](../../src/orchestration/orchestratorHelpers.test.ts#L11)).
